> I am currently working to interface a TE16 to a PDP 11/44. 

The TE16 is a MASSBUS tape drive. You will need a formatter,
which is often in the drive cabinet, a MASSBUS cable and an
RH11 MASSBUS interface, which is in its own prewired system
unit. The card arrangement for the RH11 should be in the print
set which should be on bitsavers.

